OL,3,GNEWSAFraud warning after phone scammers
OL,4,Apose as police
OL,5,
OL,6,FA police force has warned that
OL,7,Fcriminals are posing as officers to
OL,8,Fattempt to obtain personal information
OL,9,Fover the phone.
OL,11,FKent Police said "several members of
OL,12,Fthe public reported receiving phone
OL,13,Fcalls" from people impersonating their
OL,14,Fstaff on Wednesday.
OL,16,F"Victims were asked for information,
OL,17,Ffrom what falsely appeared to be a Kent
OL,18,FPolice number, that in the wrong hands
OL,19,Fcould be used in an attempt to commit
OL,20,Ffinancial fraud," a spokesperson said.
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
